---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Privacy" current="privacy">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p class="lede">This site doesn't collect, store or share your personal information.</p>
  <ul class="prose">
    <li><strong>No cookies, analytics or trackers.</strong> There are no third-party scripts, fonts or embeds.</li>
    <li><strong>Calculations run in your browser.</strong> The details you enter (such as age group, sex or weight) are never sent to us.</li>
    <li><strong>Settings in links.</strong> When you use the planner, your settings are written into the page address so you can bookmark or share them. Anyone you send that link to can see those settings.</li>
    <li><strong>"Remember my settings" is optional and off by default.</strong> If you tick it, your settings are saved in your own browser's local storage on this device only, and never sent anywhere. Untick it, or press "Forget", to delete them.</li>
    <li><strong>Hosting.</strong> The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. Like any web host, GitHub may log technical information such as IP addresses for security; see <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub's privacy statement</a>.</li>
  </ul>
</Base>
